        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ala makĩaa, na ala matetĩkĩlaa, na ala mathatasya, na oaani, na ilaalai, na aoi, na athaithi ma mĩvw’anano, na onthe ala maneenaa ũvũngũ, kĩanda kyoo kĩkeethĩwa ĩianĩ yĩla yakanaa mwaki na mũvĩlĩtĩ; nayo nĩa kĩkw’ũ kya kelĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
